flowchart LR
    ADMIN[Use case authors\nERP pillar / module / process] --> APP[Use Case Library application\nUI + API + database]
    SCHED[Weekly scheduled refresh] --> FN
    APP -- Take Assessment or publish use cases --> FN[UseCase AI Question Generator\nOCI Function]

    FN --> OS[(OCI Object Storage\nUseCase_AI/)]
    OS -- chroma_store.zip --> CH[ChromaDB vector store\nunpacked in /tmp]
    FN --> CH
    CH -- persisted zip --> OS

    FN --> META{Delta detection\nchecksum per use case}
    META -- new or changed --> GAI[OCI Generative AI\nCohere Command R+]
    META -- unchanged --> SKIP[Skip regeneration]
    GAI -- 5 MCQs + answer + explanation --> FN
    FN -- questions/pillar/module/process/case.json --> OS
    FN -- usecase_meta.json --> OS

    FN -- full question set --> APP
    APP --> DB[(Application DB\nquestions, answers, explanations)]
    DB -- PL/SQL random selection\nquestions and options only --> EMP[Employee assessment]
    EMP -- submitted answers --> DB
    DB -- score + explanations --> EMP
